{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regarding: Returning to the University Era</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">University is one of the most beautiful journeys in life. We have many beautiful memories and regrets in university.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return to College &quot;is a text-based adventure game set against the backdrop of college campus life, giving you a chance to revisit or make up for your regrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day when you are reborn and return to college, will you choose to follow the rules and make some money by simply using information asymmetry to live a better life, or will you decide to make up for your past regrets, choose an adventurous life, integrate various resources, plan your life in advance, and pursue the various goddesses you have met in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here, there are various goddesses with different styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/xiaohua\u526f\u672c.png?t=1742006285\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/xiaobiaojie.png?t=1742006285\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/wenxueshaonv_.png?t=1742006285\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/\u75c5\u5a07\u5973.png?t=1742006285\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544100?t=1742006285","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544100?t=1742006285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/5585b7d1883aa3fec931c1e3eb150a4928ed4a7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742006285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_